{"strongs": "H8467", "word": "תְּחִנּה", "translit": "te.chin.nah", "root": "חנך", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "favour, supplication for favour", "definition": "תְּחִנּה noun feminine favour, supplication for favour ; — ׳ ת Josh 11:20 + 4 t.; construct תְּחִנַּת 1Kgs 8:30 ; 1Kgs 8:52 (twice in verse); תְּחִנָּתִי Jer 37:20 + 5 t.; תְּחִנֹּתֵיהֶם 2Chr 6:39 etc. + 10 t. suffix; — 1. favour , shewn by Israel Josh 11:29 ( D ); מאת יהוה Ezra 9:8 . 2. supplication for favour , from God 1Kgs 8:52 (twice in verse); 2Chr 33:13 ; Ps 119:170 || תְּפִלָּה 1Kgs 8:28 = 2Chr 6:19 ; Ps 6:10 ; Ps 55:2 תפלה (ו)תחנה 1Kgs 8:38 ; 1Kgs 8:45 ; 1Kgs 8:49 ; 1Kgs 8:54 = 2Chr 6:29 ; 2Chr 6:35 ; 2Chr 6:39 ; 1Kgs 9:3 אשׁר התפלל ׳ ת 1Kgs 8:30 (= תַּחֲנוּן 2Chr 6:21 ); לִפְנֵי ׳ תִּפֹּלּ ת let the supplication fall before , Yahweh Jer 36:7 , the king Jer 37:20 , Jeremiah Jer 42:2 לפני ׳ הִפִּיל ת present supplication before , Yahweh Jer 42:9 ; Dan 9:20 , the king Jer 38:26 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2953')\">BDB2953</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8467')\">H8467</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2952')\">BDB2952</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2954')\">BDB2954</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>תְּחִנּה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>favour, supplication for favour</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 11:20\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,20)\">Josh 11:20</ref> + 4 t.; construct <bdbheb>תְּחִנַּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:30\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,30)\">1Kgs 8:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:52\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,52)\">1Kgs 8:52</ref> (twice in verse); <bdbheb>תְּחִנָּתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 37:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,37,20)\">Jer 3